
GUARDIAN is a real-time safety and emergency monitoring application connected to a wearable hardware device.

## Features

- Real-time safety dashboard
- Heart-rate monitoring
- Movement monitoring
- GPS location tracking
- SOS emergency button
- Emergency status screen
- Emergency service calling


## Technology

- React Native
- Expo
- JavaScript
- ESP32
- GPS
- Health and motion sensors

## Project Status

Prototype / MVP

The current application demonstrates the interface and emergency workflow. Hardware integration is planned as the next stage.
